{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/10/7536074/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらきらきらきらきら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVの制服の素材がすきなんだよね。\nナチュラルでかわいい。\nボロボロしたリボンもかわいい。\nでも、新制服もすきなんだー\n白っていいよね。\n白色好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどっちの制服がすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\nこんばんはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂から出てストレッチしてるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/10/7536074/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなさん\n耳嫌いじゃないって言ってくれて\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/10/7536074/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳が喜んでおられるぞ。\n真っ赤ですぞ。\nエルフみたいなとんがり耳さんを\nこれからもよろしくなんだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のブログって\n急にくそまじめになったりするから\nどうやってコメントしたらいいか\n困ってしまうねーうーんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/10/7536074/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントありがとうみなさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/10/7536074/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下で荒ぶる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}